# Nonmagnetic fcc Pt test cell, a = 7.41 bohr (3.921 angstrom).
# The installed SG15 potential is scalar relativistic: no spin-orbit coupling.
lattice face-centered Cubic 7.41
coords-type lattice
ion Pt 0 0 0 0
include results/pseudo.in
coulomb-interaction periodic
spintype no-spin
elec-ex-corr gga-PBE
elec-cutoff 40
elec-n-bands 40
elec-smearing Fermi 0.01
